step	1	-	Quick guide step 1
line	<col=000080>Talk to <col=800000>Redbeard Frank</col> by the pub to the north <col=800000>Port Sarim</col> dock.</col>
step	2	-	Quick guide step 2
line	<str>Talk to Redbeard Frank by the pub to the north Port Sarim dock.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Travel to <col=800000>Musa Point</col> for 30 coins (talk to <col=800000>Seaman Thresnor</col>, <col=800000>Seaman Lorris</col>, or <col=800000>Captain Tobias</col> on the south-west docks).</col>
step	3	-	Quick guide step 3
line	<str>Talk to Redbeard Frank by the pub to the north Port Sarim dock.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to Musa Point for 30 coins (talk to Seaman Thresnor, Seaman Lorris, or Captain Tobias on the south-west docks).</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Head west to the <col=800000>Karamja Wines, Spirits, and Beers</col> bar and buy one <col=800000>Karamjan rum</col> for 30 coins. (Do not try to leave the island with the rum.)</col>
step	4	-	Quick guide step 4
line	<str>Talk to Redbeard Frank by the pub to the north Port Sarim dock.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to Musa Point for 30 coins (talk to Seaman Thresnor, Seaman Lorris, or Captain Tobias on the south-west docks).</str>
line	
line	<str>Head west to the Karamja Wines, Spirits, and Beers bar and buy one Karamjan rum for 30 coins. (Do not try to leave the island with the rum.)</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Grab 10 Bananas from the nearby trees.</col>
step	5	-	Quick guide step 5
line	<str>Talk to Redbeard Frank by the pub to the north Port Sarim dock.</str>
line	
