step	6	-	Quick guide step 6
line	<str>Talk to Redbeard Frank by the pub to the north Port Sarim dock.</str>
line	
line	<str>Travel to Musa Point for 30 coins (talk to Seaman Thresnor, Seaman Lorris, or Captain Tobias on the south-west docks).</str>
line	
line	<str>Head west to the Karamja Wines, Spirits, and Beers bar and buy one Karamjan rum for 30 coins. (Do not try to leave the island with the rum.)</str>
line	
